<< /A 451 0 R /ActualText (Bar chart showing average final gains for the one-shot zero-sum game across languages: English, French, Arabic, Chinese, and Vietnamese. Each language section includes bars for combinations of personalities \(C C, C S, S S\) and models: Mistral Large, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, GPT-4.0, and Llama 3 405B Instruct. Bars depict varying values with some positive and some negative gains, indicating diverse performance outcomes.\r\n) /Alt (Bar chart showing average final gains for the one-shot zero-sum game across languages: English, French, Arabic, Chinese, and Vietnamese. Each language section includes bars for combinations of personalities \(C C, C S, S S\) and models: Mistral Large, Claude 3.5 Sonnet, GPT-4.0, and Llama 3 405B Instruct. Bars depict varying values with some positive and some negative gains, indicating diverse performance outcomes.\r\n) /K 0 /P 44 0 R /Pg 268 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
